{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a47828712d181e5b8434debbae758c59c5d51917319fda9286a54131f78e5a46", "ja": "バズの夜が明けて", "zh": "爆火之夜破晓后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d34d9062c010b6014a413695b140da48ba57ef8a346c00ac1ba6e1dbf4a01461", "ja": "投稿したドライブ動画は大いにバズった。\n改めて、2人は企画を通して知った互いの\n意外な一面に驚くとともに、アイドルとして\n結果を残せた事にも嬉しさを覚える。そして\n一層、仕事への気合いを入れるのだった。", "zh": "投稿的兜风视频大受欢迎。\n重新审视之下，2人不仅为通过企划了解到的\n彼此意想不到的一面感到惊讶，同时也为能作为偶像\n做出成果而感到高兴。并且，\n大家对工作也投入了更多干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9772a82f5c3df216489e778e328c883125021a5be0e87bf5652d99041e264555", "ja": "（昨夜の爆走……ではなくドライブを終えた翌日。\n歌織さんと紬、きちんと休めたかな……）", "zh": "（结束了昨晚的狂飙……不对，是兜风后的第二天。歌织小姐和紬，应该好好休息过了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "de518d28bb945f5b35db56b5530d7a7c8401473d61db44adfe51a1c35ae19723", "ja": "あの……桜守さん。\n例の投稿への反応、ご存知ですか……？", "zh": "那个……樱守小姐。\n关于那条投稿的反响，您知道了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "021fda47d355bb16bbace63525b094fcb748f42bebb29569e04503caf19823d1", "ja": "ええ、なんとなくは。スマホが鳴り止まなかったから、\n通知はオフにしてしまったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，大概知道一些。因为手机一直响个不停，所以我把通知关掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "ae46b6b3bfd582de3b10d65d7961df54c909ab3f01f84e613a148202af0af710", "ja": "でも、最後に見た時は確か……\n再生回数50万を超えてたくらい、かしら……？", "zh": "不过，我最后看到的时候，好像已经超过50万次播放了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2fb33303d45c855493573a8d8370bd6ac7535cf870072ece0771168430352b1e", "ja": "ああ……まさか、あのドライブ動画が\n本当にバズってしまうなんて……！", "zh": "啊……没想到，那段兜风视频居然真的火起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ab2dc43f7e59d133b1e7a023fce9552169e04a925c24c4175b733ab79b57265", "ja": "あの動画が今も何百人……\nいえ、何万人にも見られているかと思うと……！", "zh": "一想到那个视频现在也正被几百人……\n不，正被几万人看着，我就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "7fede1c9f5e60f4349a4039169a93de8c314284e95641a9d126f88d1fca9acbe", "ja": "そうね。紬ちゃんが戸惑うのも、無理はないと思うわ。\nこんな膨大な数字、まるで実感がないし……。", "zh": "是啊，紬会感到不知所措，我觉得也是情有可原的。  \n这么庞大的数字，完全让人没有真实感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "de2ba055c912841c54938bac9893eed37757da2353729c8543c9a445520b5618", "ja": "少し時間も経ったし、\nみんなのコメントを確認してみましょうか。", "zh": "也过去了一会儿，\n我们来看看大家的评论吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "75a69d0c22adaed8227639e1e0c9cc84cb414835906ea210e7254eb2b9825ee3", "ja": "えっと……『私も歌織さんの車に乗せてほしいな～♪\n紬ちゃんみたいにナビできないかもだけど……』", "zh": "呃……“我也想坐歌织小姐的车呢～♪\n虽然可能没法像紬那样帮忙导航……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e7cf1fb06245b694016ecf8d519df4e5197d6a29b80b2c8d4437a7ef54ff4df5", "ja": "『アクション映画の撮影でもしてるのかな？\nふたりの今まで見れなかった一面って感じ！』", "zh": "“是在拍动作电影吗？\n感觉看到了两人之前没展现过的一面呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5c1adad71556b5201794697365ec92f840f43fe26d0959f551d66080db10ad95", "ja": "今まで見れなかった一面……た、確かにあんな姿を\n見せたことはありませんが……。", "zh": "以往从未见过的一面……确、确实，我从来没让人见过那副模样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e241a6da081d07953bc660891f5a0e85d8f12b8730156b6f7fd36ba245c51006", "ja": "……。\nそういえば、つい先ほどまでの桜守さんも……。", "zh": "……。\n这么说来，刚才的樱守小姐也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cdb59b382c2305428b65d9ba656f132202c260d408a928b13e004ebdbee7c364", "ja": "朝が弱いと噂には聞いていましたが……\nあれも、私にとっては見たことのない一面でした。", "zh": "我听说过您早上不太好起来……\n不过那一面，对我来说也是从未见过的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "f539395f883865b5994f1678645d8667afa30358caff5bfa87df809bdf1583aa", "ja": "も、もう紬ちゃん！\nあれは忘れてもらって大丈夫だから……！", "zh": "真、真是的，紬！\n那件事你忘了就好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c7f041768d4b7dd56956aa2af8e47e32379cce69b0dedec659f2dceb6a58d93e", "ja": "あのふにゃふにゃしたかわいらしい人が、\n昨夜、高速道路を爆走した人と同一人物とは……。", "zh": "那个软绵绵的可爱之人，\n和昨晚在高速公路上狂飙的人居然是同一个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dda5745f77dea3110a0bc07d01faa1b875c61c9d061ecd0f791682d942990794", "ja": "私は、桜守さんのことを\n何も知らなかったのですね……。", "zh": "原来我对樱守小姐一无所知……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "6b704e8a560f91c8798b4438a3ddcf80e63e5d4afeb807563962f9853d4a8059", "ja": "それを言うなら、私だって。\n紬ちゃんのことを何も知らなかったんだって思ったわ。", "zh": "要这么说的话，我也是。仔细想想，我原来对紬一无所知。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "1bc9f913c459d565a8b081031f1023a169041c32e66256846b7888e3cf012102", "ja": "ナビが先を見越していて的確なこととか、\n動画撮影までこなすしっかり者なところとか……。", "zh": "比如导航会未雨绸缪、判断准确，\n还很能干，连视频拍摄都能完成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "8511c9331ef26e6d2cff5d9550d7d343c1d838ed232487e0aae0580afeaae2e2", "ja": "近くにいるのに、気付かないことってあるのね。", "zh": "明明就在身边，却也会有注意不到的时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5198348263d58a62a04ca2729e9d713f9c53e57737719d7e98eb2699c7659590", "ja": "ええ。近くにいるから、尚のこと、\n気づけなかったのかもしれません。", "zh": "是啊。正因为就在身边，才更加没能察觉到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "8bd6a4193a20dceafb4899ddf8ea3c17bbc90dfdcb8250ba7503b81de5ae8ee8", "ja": "紬ちゃん。今回、紬ちゃんとユニットが組めて、\n私、とっても楽しいわ。", "zh": "紬。这次能和紬组成组合，我特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5fc1875e323aee154997a0ace9f70b4a6532b46ecc2d67e819f5313708e42e67", "ja": "私もです。", "zh": "我也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "7c0d642460147da9bc5dae5d809516845941efb9b72dda8e944f721529273a88", "ja": "あ……でも{$P$}さん、\nあの動画を投稿する前、紬ちゃんに言ってたわよね。", "zh": "啊……不过，{$P$}先生，\n在发布那个视频之前，你不是也对紬说过吗？\n\n“如果实在不想发布，就告诉我。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "98b62008866a38effcbd051a926c7e6925c70656c705efcd728f6137693dd6d3", "ja": "「どうしても投稿が嫌だったら、教えてくれ」って。\n……紬ちゃん、本当によかったの？", "zh": "“如果你实在不想发布，就告诉我”。\n……纺，真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "35fb26168edda65641dbdb78d7b2892d799db1b237f400efa6f8810281d3f0c7", "ja": "そうですね……完全に納得したわけではありません。\nただ……。", "zh": "是这样……我也不是完全接受了。\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "1d1fbd711a69f70f11047f42db76b8b0d9870b78eacfff092cdb1b91565472d1", "ja": "ただ？", "zh": "只是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "621a67cf32fc9ee39ac037c56d280dba1ce9fc5960b56bfe1e9fd7191f22b564", "ja": "桜守さんと組ませてもらって「こんなものか」という\n結果しか残せなかったら、困ると思って。", "zh": "如果和樱守一起组队，最后只能留下“不过如此”的结果，我会很困扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "59dd17187dd924da0a065fa4efb94608bc9b1e41e6b79263440b55d725bc9204", "ja": "ふふっ……そうよね。\nうん、私もまったく同じ気持ち。", "zh": "呵呵……是啊。\n嗯，我也是完全一样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "b5073bd4b3c4c08a050d0c16a192866f9b34d0441711c225fd1f39a24cacb3b5", "ja": "期待を超えてこそのアイドル、ですものね？", "zh": "超越期待，才是偶像该有的样子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ef8f91fe002a48a38c080c8a9a8826bd3dd93616cf9fb9b78e7d88f2f3a2da5e", "ja": "はい。{$P$}も、\nきっとそう言うと思います。", "zh": "是的。我想，{$P$}也一定会这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1031_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "b734a7c2e913486f5ef0ea02a08cb4452a4282ea298da98a19e6a7e679667fe5", "ja": "あら、噂をすれば……。", "zh": "哎呀，说曹操曹操到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b166963cf45e4163d750e171789e084e1db51d122f029c40d98634b40a2ad922", "ja": "おはようございます、歌織さん、紬。\nそろそろ出かける時間だけど、準備は……。", "zh": "早上好，歌织、紬。\n差不多该出发了，准备得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "bc8cd866fc19859d024d87fb69668aa85658a300489b1ba5a3be1e71775fdc13", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\nええ、バッチリです♪", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}先生。\n嗯，已经准备得万无一失了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8fcf75a70eb00a7a6728f931d09bc663295cbd991ebb1bdf4672a20d45d724f4", "ja": "それでは、参りましょうか。\n今日のお仕事も、がんばりましょう。", "zh": "那么，我们出发吧。\n今天的工作也一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1036_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3cb4895beee432f011005b619917728e5145f6bd0f919c7dddca48e7f34abb05", "ja": "今日も金沢での仕事が目白押しだ！　ラジオも\n反響がよくて、追加のゲスト依頼が来てるんだ。", "zh": "今天在金泽的工作也排得满满的！广播节目反响很好，还收到了追加嘉宾的邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7209bd25d7d683e5116790bad3c15cc8fe16d57afa62d96d59b859b18c7f81f6", "ja": "そうすると、また金沢まで来なくちゃなんだけど……。", "zh": "这样一来，就又得来金泽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "9fd842748535dab4bf6e7aa2e30089c23fac162ac9e1097c17feaa670749710d", "ja": "もちろん大丈夫です。頂いた依頼は、\n全部引き受けるつもりですから。", "zh": "当然没问题。我打算把您委托的工作，全部接下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "5410aed6489e6ae158b36bc93b24c293f43e602db3d0772ae8a98ef00b810fa4", "ja": "頼もしい限りですね！　あと、ふたりの\n振袖姿での撮影依頼なんかも来てますね。", "zh": "真让人放心！另外，也有委托找你们两个穿振袖拍照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "a82621850c6f3b2fbf5edb9671c5fa216f25ecd38c39aa34bafced082ff66181", "ja": "振袖姿……さすが、金沢らしいお仕事ですね。\nあまり、和服には慣れていないんですけど……。", "zh": "穿着振袖的样子……不愧是金泽风格的工作呢。\n我不太习惯穿和服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1042_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b684f8129864dfeae9801cc2cc44c2767f550512377ebb4ecddbb99f36ab9ab0", "ja": "それでしたら、僭越ながら\n私がお手伝いさせていただきます。", "zh": "这样的话，请容我冒昧帮您一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "477b68511e95df6b261835b9d33b5c496b013c484ff24c76a66a6ae2de1cc31b", "ja": "私の家にも、いろいろありますし……\n試しに着ていただくこともできますから。", "zh": "我家里也有各种各样的衣服……还可以让您试着穿穿看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "8891699d29b65f52e60d3ccf57899f379dc09a0035e35ce2616804a0b5548c56", "ja": "おお、そうだな！　紬の実家に協力してもらって、\nお店とコラボするのもいいかもしれないな。", "zh": "哦，说得也是！拜托紬的老家帮忙，和店铺合作也许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1045_051tmg", "source_sha256": "148b900a33e0301d4e1afbc1240b2bf0719ddcff7fd66ed449426dc9e4fa91fe", "ja": "……。もしかして、最初からこの路線でいけば、\nあの動画を投稿しなくても済んだのでは……。", "zh": "……。难道说，如果打从一开始就走这条路线，\n其实根本就不用投稿那个视频……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1046_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb9473fedf69f41ca7a6d1395438f980000a53f91e0aa90ce730fdcdeb3e5d7c", "ja": "あなたはもしや、動画を投稿させるために\nわざとこのタイミングで……？", "zh": "难道你是为了让我投稿视频，\n才故意挑了这个时机……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1047_p", "source_sha256": "294bbd4778b95080e2ef892000fbf167ea6e22359a2c471a1ebe40f7b49843de", "ja": "た、たまたま！　本当に今朝、\n打診が来ただけだから！", "zh": "只、只是碰巧！真的只是今天早上才收到邀约！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "45c163a0cb8198cb5172d3732c471e97d013a9891258e2b810bc20f2d134bfdc", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだかうれしいわね。\n今度はおしとやかな動画がバズるといいんだけど。", "zh": "呵呵，总觉得有点开心呢。\n这次要是优雅端庄的视频也能火起来就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1049_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3ca5178396e96503ce9799e4a996a3ea01284f57b985276cac9095e6deb8191", "ja": "そうですね……それは、まったくそのとおりです。\nふふっ。", "zh": "是啊……确实完全如您所说。\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1050_051tmg", "source_sha256": "476475dda85ec75c95224ea2209acaeb67a3b5ba132eb14268144fa1cc4cc56a", "ja": "桜守さんだけに、いいところを持っていかせは\nしません。今度は私が決めてみせます。", "zh": "我可不会只让樱守小姐抢尽风头。下次我一定要由我来拿下关键一击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1051_052kao", "source_sha256": "b2ea0596f545be3c07923840f6b7fad8be5cacc6131021028e9657891feba779", "ja": "ええ！　とっても楽しみだわ♪", "zh": "嗯！我非常期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0284_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_06_1052_p", "source_sha256": "b6639cf8f35140845b5657bab96c9e1fe3b8fff37ed926b4a7f01b79b01ef682", "ja": "（少しだけ、ふたりの間の空気が変わった気がする。\nまだまだ、忙しくなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（感觉两人之间的气氛稍微变了变。看来接下来还会越来越忙啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
